Sir Morgan's Armor	29	{"kind":"quest","title":"Sir Morgan's Armor","wikiPath":"/Sir_Morgan's_Armor","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Eastern Plains of Karana","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Sir Morgan","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Patchwork Cloak","item":"Patchwork Cloak","wikiPath":"/Patchwork_Cloak"}],"card":{"title":"Sir Morgan's Armor","lines":["Minimum Level: 1+","Classes: All","Related Zones: None","Related NPCs: None"]},"links":["Eastern Plains of Karana","Sir Morgan","Patchwork Cloak","Patchwork Boots","Silver Earring","Bloodstone","Halfling Knife","Bronze Dagger","Belt Pouch","Damask Cap","Mountain Lion Cape","Highkeep Flask","Snakeskin Mask","Drom's Champagne","Squire Wimbley"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Squire Wimbley","text":"Hello! Good to meet you. The road ahead is full of all sorts of nasty creatures. If I were you, I would speak with my master, Sir Morgan."},{"npc":"Sir Morgan","text":"Hail, traveler! Might I escort you through to Highpass? The path ahead is filled with giants and many other hungry beasts. I assure you, you will be safe with me. I must admit, I am quite experienced in the ways of the warrior. Do you [wish an escort] or will you [travel alone]?"},{"npc":"Sir Morgan","text":"I shall be honored to escort you to Highpass, but you shall have to wait for a spell. I make trips every few hours. I also would be grateful to any who wish to donate gold coins to the upkeep of my armor. The rains in the plains cause much rusting."},{"npc":"Sir Morgan","text":"Then, good luck to you! May your faith protect you. Or at the very least, guide you to a grand afterlife."},{"npc":"Sir Morgan","text":"What a grand donation!! You must be a rich noble to be making such a donation. Here. I am but a simple warrior, but I found this lying on the highway to Highpass Hold. The lifeless corpse next to it had no more need of it."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-26T06:28:51.277Z","outOfEra":false}
